<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;line-height:1.7;max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}
h1{font-size:22pt;color:#111827;border-bottom:3px solid #c5a028;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
h2{font-size:14pt;color:#111827;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:4px;border-left:4px solid #4fd1c5;padding-left:12px;background:#f4fdfc}
h3{font-size:12pt;color:#374151;margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:bold}
p{margin:4px 0 10px}
.meta{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:10pt}
.meta p{margin:3px 0}
.meta strong{color:#b7881c}
.sec{border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0}
.card-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11.5pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 4px}
.card-sub{font-size:10pt;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 4px;font-style:italic}
.card-desc{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}
.step-num{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;color:#c5a028;min-width:40px;line-height:1}
.step-body .step-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 3px}
.step-body .step-desc{font-size:10.5pt;color:#374151;margin:0}
.faq{border-left:3px solid #4fd1c5;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.faq-q{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;margin:0 0 5px}
.faq-a{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.cta{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:28px}
.cta h2{color:#4fd1c5;border:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 8px;background:transparent;font-size:15pt}
.cta p{color:#d1d5db;margin:4px 0}
.cta .btn{display:inline-block;background:#4fd1c5;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10pt}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:10.5pt}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
td:first-child{color:#6b7280}
td:last-child{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;text-align:right}
ul{padding-left:18px}
ul li{padding:2px 0;color:#374151}
</style></head><body><h1>Mortgage Process</h1><div class="meta"><p><strong>Page Title:</strong> The Mortgage Process: Step-by-Step Guide | Rob Miller | MadCity</p><p><strong>Meta Description:</strong> Understand the home loan process from start to finish. Our 12-step guide explains pre-approval, house hunting, and closing your Wisconsin mortgage. Licensed in 11 states. Call 608-227-2002.</p></div><div class="sec"><div class="badge">How It Works</div><br><h2>The Mortgage Process: 12 Steps to Homeownership</h2><p>Knowledge is power. We believe a stress-free closing starts with understanding the road ahead. Our 12-step guide walks you through every milestone from your first call to your final signature.</p><p><strong>CTA Button:</strong> Book Strategy Session</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Steps</h2><div class="step"><div class="step-num">01</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Initial Consultation</p><p class="step-desc">We discuss your goals, budget, and long-term financial plans to identify the best loan program for your specific purchase or refinance goals.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">02</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Application & Documents</p><p class="step-desc">You submit your official application and provide supporting documentation (paystubs, W-2s, tax returns, and bank statements) securely.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">03</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Verified Pre-Approval</p><p class="step-desc">We perform a complete review of your financial file and issue a strong pre-approval letter, giving you the power to shop with confidence.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">04</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">The House Hunt</p><p class="step-desc">You work with your Realtor to search for the perfect home and submit offers backed by your verified mortgage pre-approval.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">05</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Offer Acceptance</p><p class="step-desc">Once the seller accepts your offer, you are officially under contract and we begin processing the specific property loan file.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">06</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Loan Processing</p><p class="step-desc">Our dedicated processing team verifies all loan details, updates required paperwork, and schedules the property appraisal.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">07</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Home Appraisal</p><p class="step-desc">An independent appraiser visits the property to verify its fair market value and ensure the collateral protects your investment.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">08</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Underwriting Review</p><p class="step-desc">Our underwriter reviews the complete credit, income, asset, and property documentation to verify guideline compliance.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">09</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Conditional Approval</p><p class="step-desc">We issue an approval with "conditions" — usually minor requests for updated paystubs, statements, or property clarifications.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">10</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Clear to Close</p><p class="step-desc">The best three words in real estate! All loan conditions are satisfied, and your files are officially cleared for closing day.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">11</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Closing Disclosure (CD)</p><p class="step-desc">You receive a detailed final breakdown of all interest rates, terms, and closing costs. You have a 3-day window to review before signing.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">12</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Closing Day!</p><p class="step-desc">You sign the final loan documents, coordinate your remaining down payment funds, and receive the keys to your new home.</p></div></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Main Page Content</h2><h3>YOUR JOURNEY TO A NEW HOME.</h3><h3>HOW LONG DOES IT TAKE?</h3><p>Transparency is our priority. Here is the step-by-step roadmap of exactly what happens after you partner with the Rob Miller Home Loan Team.</p><p>While every situation is unique, a typical Wisconsin home purchase transaction takes 30 to 45 days from offer acceptance to closing day. Refinance options often close even faster.</p><p>The Rob Miller Home Loan Team is optimized for speed. In competitive markets, we coordinate fast approvals and closing times to help your offer stand out and win.</p></div><div class="cta"><h2>Ready to Take Step 1?</h2><p>The first step is a simple conversation. No pressure, no cost — just expert advice.</p><span class="btn">Schedule My Consultation</span></div></body></html>